,"type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron).","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define whether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio"}],"title":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/OUDSWCAG21Ratio/requirementsAA":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio\/requirementsaa","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"WCAG 2.1 requirement for AA level needs to have textual component matching 4.5:1 contrast ratio"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and non textual component matching 3:1 contrast ratio."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is recommended for web projects."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio\/requirementsAA","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requirementsAA"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:15OUDSFoundations18WCAG21R